    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "you say it's \"diluted the intrinsic value\" though... so you're saying that when art becomes more about a message, it's actually objectively less valuable as art? wouldn't a piece of art be more \"successful\" if it actually moved people or made them think about society, even if it wasn't \"beautiful\" in the traditional sense?",
